# Build and process output. MVP_PLAN_V3.md §5: never imported by runtime code, and its
# absence must not break any build. Holds agent handoffs and oracle evidence files.
.artifacts/

# Session-local agent state. `.claude/` is engineering infrastructure; a checkpoint recording
# one session's recovery attempts is not a fact about the repository.
.claude/*.local.md

# Supervisor control state: leases, worker transcripts, the run journal, the escalation
# record. Machine-local by construction — it names pids and session ids on THIS machine, and
# `pnpm autopilot` reconstructs everything else from git and `.artifacts/`.
.autopilot/
